sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    actor Steward
    participant Page as Web pages<br/>admin gallery, admin site page<br/>(DeleteImageButton), new-report
    participant Api as Image delete route<br/>DELETE /api/site-images?id=&kind=
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>attachments,<br/>homepage_image_uploads
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Admin,S3: Covers US 7.0.5. The image delete route and deleteObjectsByKeys (utils/media/s3Delete.ts) exist.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Note over Admin,S3: Delete an image (AT 1, AT 2, AT 3)
    Admin->>Page: Open the admin gallery (/api/gallery, /api/homepage-images) or the admin site page<br/>(/api/sites/[siteId]/gallery, /api/homepage-images/[siteId]). Both exist.
    Page->>Page: Show Delete only on the two admin pages (AT 2). The public site page has no Delete
    Admin->>Page: Select Delete on an image and confirm<br/>("Confirm delete" or "Cancel")
    Page->>Api: DELETE ?id={image id}&kind=attachments or homepage_image_uploads
    Api->>Api: Check app_metadata.role = admin and app_metadata.authenticated = true (exists).<br/>RLS delete policies also require an Admin
    alt No signed-in user
        Api-->>Page: 401. Nothing is deleted
    else Caller is not Admin (AT 2)
        Api-->>Page: 403. Nothing is deleted
    else Caller is Admin
        Api->>Api: Check kind and id. A bad value returns 400
        Api->>DB: Read storage_key from the table of that kind:<br/>attachments or homepage_image_uploads
        alt Row is not found
            DB-->>Api: No row
            Api-->>Page: 404. Nothing is deleted
        else Row is found
            DB-->>Api: storage_key
            Api->>DB: Delete that row from the same table
            alt Row delete fails
                DB-->>Api: Error
                Api-->>Page: Error 500. Row and file are kept
            else Row is deleted
                DB-->>Api: OK
                Api->>S3: deleteObjectsByKeys([storage_key]) (AT 3)
                alt S3 delete fails
                    S3-->>Api: Error
                    Api-->>Page: Error 500. Row is already deleted.<br/>The S3 object stays (no retry)
                else File is deleted
                    S3-->>Api: OK
                    Api-->>Page: Success
                    Page-->>Admin: Image is gone from gallery and reports (AT 1)
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over Api,S3: Open question: a retry or a cleanup for orphaned S3 objects.

    Note over Admin,S3: Deactivate a SIR (AT 4): this exists and keeps the files
    Admin->>Page: Deactivate a SIR on the admin site page
    Page->>Server: setFormResponseActive(responseId, false)
    Server->>Server: requireApprovedAdmin() (exists)
    Server->>DB: Set is_active false on form_responses
    Note over Server,S3: Attachment rows and S3 files stay, so reactivation restores the photos.

    Note over Admin,S3: Failed SIR submission (AT 5)
    Steward->>Page: Submit new SIR with photos
    Page->>S3: PUT photos to inspections/{siteId}/{responseId}/ (exists)
    Page->>Server: uploadSiteInspectionAnswers or<br/>insertInspectionAttachments fails
    Page->>Server: rollbackSiteInspectionSubmission(responseId) (exists)
    Server->>DB: Read storage_key of stored attachments rows, then delete<br/>attachment, answer and response rows (exists)
    Server->>S3: deleteObjectsByKeys(storage_key of stored attachments rows) (exists)
    Server->>S3: Delete all objects under inspections/{siteId}/{responseId}/ (proposed)
    Page-->>Steward: Show error. SIR is not saved
    Note over Server,S3: Rollback deletes S3 objects only for attachments rows already saved.<br/>When the attachments insert fails, the uploaded files stay in S3 (gap).
